{'symbol': 'ALLE', 'date': '2023-04-26 05:30:00', 'title': 'ALLEGION REPORTS FIRST-QUARTER 2023 FINANCIAL RESULTS, RAISES FULL-YEAR 2023 OUTLOOK', 'text': 'DUBLIN--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ALLEGION PLC (NYSE: ALLE), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF SECURITY PRODUCTS AND SOLUTIONS, TODAY REPORTED FIRST-QUARTER 2023 NET REVENUES OF $923.0 MILLION AND NET EARNINGS OF $123.5 MILLION, OR $1.40 PER SHARE. EXCLUDING CHARGES RELATED TO RESTRUCTURING, ACQUISITION AND INTEGRATION COSTS, AND AMORTIZATION EXPENSE RELATED TO ACQUIRED INTANGIBLE ASSETS, ADJUSTED NET EARNINGS WERE $139.5 MILLION, OR $1.58 PER SHARE, UP 39.8% WHEN COMPARED WITH FIRST-QUARTER 2022 ADJUSTED EP.'}